Date: Fri, 14 Nov 2025 16:47:13 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 28/63] Enable MoltenVK graphics with rutabaga

Summary: Re-enable graphics flags/detection on Mac and use MoltenVK ICD with GfxStream.

Test Plan:
 DYLD_PRINT_LIBRARIES=1 DYLD_PRINT_LIBRARIES_POST_LAUNCH=1 launch_cvd -vm_manager=qemu_cli -qemu_binary_dir="/Users/tcare/qemu/build" -gpu_mode=gfxstream_guest_angle -vhost_user_vsock=true -device_external_network=slirp

# Make sure MoltenVK is loading
adb cmd gpu vkjson

Rollback Plan:

Reviewers: achong, olja, benthomas

Reviewed By: achong

Subscribers: #wearables_emulators

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.intern.facebook.com/D87120807
